## Original Work

This software represents original research and development work in:

- **Robotics**: Pepper robot control and management systems
- **Artificial Intelligence**: Natural language processing and conversational AI
- **Computer Vision**: Face recognition and detection systems
- **Cloud Computing**: Distributed systems and cloud integration
- **Full-Stack Development**: Backend APIs and web interfaces

